# BL-878: set from one counted run through scripts/seed-verdict-store.sh (core/scripts/hermetic-run.sh, the judge's own
# J3/J7 output); base was * 32, scripts/plan-rotate.sh 27 and scripts/validate-plan-shape.sh 3. The rotator starts
# only in the two cli cells of cells.decl; the validator starts nowhere. The inproc rows are one pass per prt_main or
# vps_main call of a sandbox root's copy (drive, the second pointer step, batch_run, the three cwd runs and the two
# pr_eqv in-process sides; vps_ip's two calls). The rest of * is run.sh and its one missing-subject re-invocation.
4 *
2 scripts/plan-rotate.sh
0 scripts/validate-plan-shape.sh
29 inproc:scripts/plan-rotate.sh
2 inproc:scripts/validate-plan-shape.sh
